Think: Normalize each temp_workspace/numbers_*.txt by extracting the first integer per line into temp_workspace/norm_numbers_*.txt.

Act: bash

```bash
awk '{
  n=split(FILENAME,a,"/"); base=a[n];
  out="temp_workspace/norm_" base;
  if (match($0, /[+-]?[0-9]+/)) print substr($0,RSTART,RLENGTH) >> out;
}
' temp_workspace/numbers_*.txt
```

